# Prisma Schema Overview

This page explains the Prisma schema used for the **Enterprise Asset Management** (EAM) system we’re building.  
It defines the database tables (*models*) and relationships for assets, schedules, inspections, and compliance tracking.

---

## Generator and Datasource

```prisma
generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "sqlite"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}
